                <note rend="inline" type="source">124.60C 3/214: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ambassador in Poland</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Cudahy</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1935-01-04T20:00:00-05:00">January 4, 1935—8
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1. Your 59, December 27, 12 a.m. American personnel of Embassy also can not be
                    subjected to laws in question.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
